note bottom of L0
  **Build Order (cascading)**
  1. ucp (zero deps)
  2. unit, persistence, user, filesystem, http, tls (parallel)
  3. web4tscomponent, web4test
  4. tootsie, pdca, idealminimal
  5. once (depends on ALL)

  Each ./component auto-builds missing deps
  via build.sh file: dependency parsing
end note

note right of once
  **@web4x/once = Runtime Kernel**
  244 files (full ONCE monolith copy)
  with file: deps to all extracted components.
  Contains files that cross component boundaries:
  HTTPSServer, ServerHierarchyManager,
  ProxyRoute, WebSocket, Layer5 Views.
end note

note right of w4tsc
  **Component Lifecycle Tool**
  create, build, test, upgrade,
  links, releaseTest, on (delegation)
  Every component uses this for
  its development workflow.
end note

